{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Ierne was written in a [[Unidentified runic alphabet|runic alphabet]] which appeared in the end credits of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Ahsoka]]'', with the first mention of the location being in "[[Part One: Master and Apprentice]]," the first episode of the show<ref name="Part One" /> which aired on [[August 22]], [[2023]].<ref name="Release">{{SW|url=news/ahsoka-new-premiere-date|text=''Ahsoka'' Premiere Moves Up to Tuesday, August 22}}</ref>

